  "prefLabel": "Mec 401.02 Proof of continuing education supporting materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 401.02 “Proof of continuing education supporting materials” means either a certificate of course completion, whether electronic or hard copy, including wallet cards, or a course roster certified by the approved seminar provider for the course.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13771, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 401.06) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 400)",
